<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 17.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA - CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR JUNE 17.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania on Monday</p>
<p>set the following currency fixings for June 17. The litas is</p>
<p>pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to one.</p>
<p>		   17.06.97	  16.06.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5468	    6.5176</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3046	    2.3145</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.4990	    4.5154</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.5029	    3.4993</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5146	    0.5140</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7675	    0.7707</p>
<p>    EEK	  0.2881	    0.2900</p>
<p>    LAT	  7.0028	    7.0096</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6947	    0.6944</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2333	    1.2353</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
